[en.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_CHERRY]
Persuade the Cherry Family

[en.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_CHERRY_desc]
Call the Cherry family members to explain the background and importance of the Second Agricultural Reform, and assure them that their interests will not be harmed.
Our phone call is very persuasive, and they ought to listen to us.

[zh.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_CHERRY]
安抚樱桃家族

[zh.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_CHERRY_desc]
打电话给樱桃家族成员，向他们解释第二次农业改革的原委和重要性，并向他们保证不会损害他们的利益。
我们的电话还是很有说服力的，他们应该会听我们的。
